STUB — replace this file with a real `cover.jpg` (1280x720 JPEG) before publishing.

The README and `pi.image` (in `package.json`) reference `assets/cover.jpg`.
The npm `package.test.ts` will refuse to ship the package if a cover is missing.

To swap on your other machine:

```sh
mv assets/cover.jpg.stub assets/cover.jpg
# then drop the real cover at assets/cover.jpg
```

Spec: 1280x720, ~70–150 kB JPEG, dark background, brand wordmark + short tagline.
Poolside reference shape: https://github.com/grikomsn/pi-provider-poolside/blob/main/assets/cover.jpg
